      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} it is still possible to get the data stolen. You still have to give persona a full ID, with unblurred data (wich is against GDPR art 5).\n\nThe ID photo should only be containing the Photo and Date of Birth",
